Z||000004||Rick 88||11-01-2001||07:19 PM||||As long as you keep the overall diamater close to the same you can leave the speedo alone. A 215/60/15 and 245/45/17 read only about 1 mph different. A 235/45/17 is just about dead on.<P>Rick 88||||reg||1
